50
00:02:29.617 --> 00:02:32.650
It's quiet, but the market is very busy in the morning.

51
00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.658
Grammar focus: It is famous for .

52
00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:38.830
Kampot is famous for pepper.

53
00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:44.125
After 'famous for', use a noun: famous for pepper, famous for its river.

54
00:02:45.117 --> 00:02:48.117
Now read and listen. Welcome to Kampot.

55
00:02:48.417 --> 00:02:51.171
My hometown is Kampot, in the south of Cambodia.

56
00:02:52.483 --> 00:02:55.563
