60
00:03:10.217 --> 00:03:12.672
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:12.972 --> 00:03:15.018
Kampot is famous blank pepper.

62
00:03:15.318 --> 00:03:17.973
A, for. B, of. C, with.

63
00:03:21.983 --> 00:03:23.460
The answer is A: for.

64
00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:27.391
The number of people in a place is its blank.

65
00:03:27.691 --> 00:03:31.437
A, population. B, province. C, market.

66
00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.682
The answer is A: population.

67
00:03:39.183 --> 00:03:41.438
Full of people and activity means blank.

68
00:03:41.738 --> 00:03:45.020
A, busy. B, quiet. C, famous.

69
00:03:49.017 --> 00:03:50.738
The answer is A: busy.

70
